      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Although it does sound cool I feel that there should still be a option for the thumbnail, allot of worlds have meh spawns that enter into something cooler to make spawning in easier. Would be a shame to no go there because the portal only shows the minimalist spawn room.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
