  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-06T08:40:04.628Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Instead of displaying a static world thumbnail, the portal should render a cubemap view of the destination world's spawn point.\n\nThis small visual change would significantly enhance the sense of traversal through a portal, making it feel more like stepping into another space rather than simply teleporting. It would also improve the overall visual fidelity and immersive quality of the portal, aligning better with the aesthetic and experiential goals of VRChat.",
